# Cloud for ISO / nested VM work

This machine is Apple silicon. Do not use local Docker `linux/amd64` or
`qemu-system-x86_64` (TCG) as the gate for building the live ISO or wiping a
throwaway disk.

Use the `gcloud` or `aws` CLI on an x86_64 Linux VM (KVM), run
`./scripts/build-iso.sh` and `docs/vm-test.md` there, copy the ISO out, and
tear the VM down. Local pytest and `python3 -m beamo_wipe --demo` are fine.
